/-- A vertex of the cumulative mask at `m + 1` is old (in the mask at `m`) or within the pad of a
vertex of color exactly `m + 1` (blueprint line 1850). -/
theorem cumMask_succ {Nv m h : ℕ} {I : T.Cell} {b : V} (hb : b ∈ K.cumMask T Nv (m + 1) h I) :
